{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get right into action with quick sessions, grow cities without the hassle of micro management, and fight thousands of enemies at run time. Adjust speed or active pause at any time to play at your pace.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457630/extras/c01a6b6cbc26a91fd53611e42abc51c6.avif?t=1764964447\" width=1200 height=200 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457630/extras/ea4872802c78d9f717cc086f055373c5.poster.avif?t=1764964447\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457630/extras/ea4872802c78d9f717cc086f055373c5.webm?t=1764964447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457630/extras/ea4872802c78d9f717cc086f055373c5.mp4?t=1764964447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Senergies buildings together to get more resources. You have 5 main resources with tons of ways to collect or grow them.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457630/extras/41fa48c2518484d3c0b58c79f9e9d76d.avif?t=1764964447\" width=1200 height=200 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457630/extras/425aa147f70a8934716731583265f597.poster.avif?t=1764964447\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457630/extras/425aa147f70a8934716731583265f597.webm?t=1764964447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457630/extras/425aa147f70a8934716731583265f597.mp4?t=1764964447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your deck of dwarves and buildings. You can spawn them if you have their cards and resources. Then you keep what you can defend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Duplicated cards turn into\u00a0efficiency and health for your buildings or survivor-like upgrades for your dwarves.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457630/extras/a2ab4348b742bd94bb50a2a3df377d02.avif?t=1764964447\" width=1200 height=200 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457630/extras/a2de3ed06cddb9d772be26308d9c67a8.poster.avif?t=1764964447\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457630/extras/a2de3ed06cddb9d772be26308d9c67a8.webm?t=1764964447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457630/extras/a2de3ed06cddb9d772be26308d9c67a8.mp4?t=1764964447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to defend your castle; if it's destroyed, you lose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use any means to defend your castle walls, dwarven shields, or throw dwarves at the problem; sometimes that can work.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457630/extras/90e6a3a2002257e19116df8eb5f293df.avif?t=1764964447\" width=1200 height=200 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457630/extras/274ba95895eb64c31597c4214975d6f2.poster.avif?t=1764964447\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457630/extras/274ba95895eb64c31597c4214975d6f2.webm?t=1764964447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457630/extras/274ba95895eb64c31597c4214975d6f2.mp4?t=1764964447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Keep in mind, not every dwarf is suited for every situation. as some are with</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High speed and damage, great for a far fight, but with their low hp, they might not be your best bet for holding enemies in place.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Massive hp and attacks very fast, zero damage attacks that distract enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Very slow reloading, but when they shoot, consider your enemy done</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some good for one to many fights, others are better in boss fights.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use different tribes, pre-run chosen perks, and roguelite upgrades to medicate your dwarves' weaknesses or make them an unstoppable, overpowered army.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457630/extras/6451c8b933c2a90f1817016ec06d4530.avif?t=1764964447\" width=1200 height=200 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457630/extras/431619d16592b6dc9d1a7bdc609b50a8.poster.avif?t=1764964447\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457630/extras/431619d16592b6dc9d1a7bdc609b50a8.webm?t=17649644