ies in place.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Massive hp and attacks very fast, zero damage attacks that distract enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Very slow reloading, but when they shoot, consider your enemy done</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some good for one to many fights, others are better in boss fights.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use different tribes, pre-run chosen perks, and roguelite upgrades to medicate your dwarves' weaknesses or make them an unstoppable, overpowered army.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457630/extras/6451c8b933c2a90f1817016ec06d4530.avif?t=1764964447\" width=1200 height=200 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457630/extras/431619d16592b6dc9d1a7bdc609b50a8.poster.avif?t=1764964447\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457630/extras/431619d16592b6dc9d1a7bdc609b50a8.webm?t=1764964447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457630/extras/431619d16592b6dc9d1a7bdc609b50a8.mp4?t=1764964447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight against thousands of enemies in real time. Can you handle them?</p>","developers":["Alaabale"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457630/e9f10b1f72f030514538db03782a8e61db1e02c1/header.jpg?t=1764964447","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"